@startuml
title Transaction Component L1 - REQUIRED + REQUIRES_NEW

autonumber
actor Caller
participant TransactionExecutor as Tx
participant PlatformTransactionManager as PTM
participant DB

Caller -> Tx: outer REQUIRED
Tx -> PTM: getTransaction(REQUIRED)
PTM --> Tx: Tx-A (OWNER)
Tx -> DB: write A

Tx -> PTM: getTransaction(REQUIRES_NEW)
PTM -> PTM: suspend Tx-A
PTM --> Tx: Tx-B (OWNER)
Tx -> DB: write B
Tx -> PTM: commit Tx-B
PTM -> PTM: resume Tx-A

Tx -> Tx: outer business throws
Tx -> PTM: rollback Tx-A

note right of DB
最终：
B 保留
A 回滚
end note
@enduml
